Day 2 - Organizing Chaos

Domain name: NMG.com

OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations

Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users

Purpose of each OU:
- Finance: the people who work with money, payments, and budgets.
- HR: the people who manage hiring, employee records, and company policies.
- IT: the people who manage computers, accounts, and technical support.
- Operations: the people who run the daily work of the company.

